request.description:
No auth required. Rate-limited. On success, response is:
```
{
  success: true,
  data: {
    user: { id, name, email, role, designation, managerId, salesTeamId, zoneId, stateId, districtId, areaId, mobile, territory, employeeCode, status, isActive, permissions: string[], ... },
    accessToken: string,   // short-lived JWT, send as 'Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>'
    refreshToken: string   // long-lived, use with /auth/refresh
  },
  message: "Login successful"
}
```
This request's Tests script auto-saves `accessToken`/`refreshToken` into the collection variables, so every other request in this collection authenticates automatically.

